# Manual API checks. Run the API (`dotnet run --project api/SchemePipeline.Api`) with Mongo up
# (`docker compose up -d`), then send requests from VS Code (REST Client) or Visual Studio.

@host = http://localhost:5080

### Health: 200 when Mongo is reachable, 503 within ~2s when it isn't
GET {{host}}/health

### Create: 201 + Location. 20 social rent homes have no value yet, so totals show unvaluedHomes = 20
# @name create
POST {{host}}/api/schemes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Riverside Phase 1",
  "siteAddress": "12 Mill Lane, Leeds LS1 4AB",
  "status": "Appraisal",
  "tenures": [
    { "tenure": "SocialRent", "homes": 20, "averageValue": null },
    { "tenure": "SharedOwnership", "homes": 15, "averageValue": 260000 },
    { "tenure": "MarketSale", "homes": 55, "averageValue": 320000 }
  ]
}

### Get the scheme just created
GET {{host}}/api/schemes/{{create.response.body.$.id}}

### Update: 200; createdAt stays the same, updatedAt moves
PUT {{host}}/api/schemes/{{create.response.body.$.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Riverside Phase 1",
  "siteAddress": "12 Mill Lane, Leeds LS1 4AB",
  "status": "Planning",
  "tenures": [
    { "tenure": "SocialRent", "homes": 20, "averageValue": 120000 },
    { "tenure": "SharedOwnership", "homes": 15, "averageValue": 260000 },
    { "tenure": "MarketSale", "homes": 55, "averageValue": 320000 }
  ]
}

### List everything, in pipeline order
GET {{host}}/api/schemes

### Filter by status and sort by value, highest first (query values are case-insensitive)
GET {{host}}/api/schemes?status=planning&sort=value&desc=true

### Portfolio summary
GET {{host}}/api/summary

### Invalid body: 400 with an error for every bad field
POST {{host}}/api/schemes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": " ",
  "siteAddress": "",
  "status": "2",
  "tenures": [
    { "tenure": "SocialRent", "homes": -1, "averageValue": 0 },
    { "tenure": "SocialRent", "homes": 1, "averageValue": 100000 },
    null
  ]
}

### Unknown filter value: 400, not an unfiltered list
GET {{host}}/api/schemes?status=Plannng

### Unknown id: 404
GET {{host}}/api/schemes/0199e5a2-0000-7000-8000-000000000000

### Malformed id: 404 (the route never matches)
GET {{host}}/api/schemes/not-a-guid
